{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50994","headline":"句 · 孟归唐","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"练色有穷处，寒声无断（《江南野史》「断」作「尽」。\n）时。\n（《瀑布》。\n见宋马令《南唐书》卷二十三《孟宾于传》。\n亦见宋龙衮《江南野史》。\n）（〖1〗《南唐书》：〖孟宾于〗初归江南，生子鱣归唐，亦能诗。\n肄业庐山国学，尝得《瀑布诗》云：「练色有穷处，寒声无断时。\n」隣房生亦得此联，遂交争之。\n助教不能辩，讼于江州。\n各以全篇意格定之，而归唐爲胜。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟归唐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50994.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50994","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}